[{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200200_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200200_01_0010","text":"凛世，我进来了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200200_01_0020","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200200_01_0030","text":"……\n那个……不……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200200_01_0040","text":"哈哈\n遇到什么开心的事了吗，凛世"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200200_01_0050","text":"呵呵……\n那个……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200200_01_0060","text":"真是不可思议……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200200_01_0070","text":"一穿上它……\n心就雀跃不已……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200200_01_0080","text":"那大概是因为……\n是放学后CLIMAX GIRLS风格的服装吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200200_01_0085","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200200_01_0090","text":"那么……\n其他各位也……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200200_01_0100","text":"啊，我想一定和凛世一样吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s10_21200200_01_0105","text":"Motion"}]
